# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.margin-block {
	margin-block-start: 1px;
	color: red;
	margin-block-end: 2px;
}

.margin-inline {
	margin-inline-end: 4px;
	margin-inline-start: 3px;
}

.padding-block {
	padding-block-start: 1px;
	padding-block-end: 2px;
}

.padding-inline {
	padding-inline-start: 1px;
	padding-inline-end: 2px;
}

.inset-block {
	inset-block-start: 1px;
	inset-block-end: 2px;
}

.inset-inline {
	inset-inline-start: 1px;
	inset-inline-end: 2px;
}

.scroll-margin-block {
	scroll-margin-block-start: 1px;
	scroll-margin-block-end: 2px;
}

.scroll-margin-inline {
	scroll-margin-inline-start: 1px;
	scroll-margin-inline-end: 2px;
}

.scroll-padding-block {
	scroll-padding-block-start: 1px;
	scroll-padding-block-end: 2px;
}

.scroll-padding-inline {
	scroll-padding-inline-start: 1px;
	scroll-padding-inline-end: 2px;
}

.border-block {
	border-block-start: 1px solid blue;
	border-block-end: 1px solid blue;
}

.border-inline {
	border-inline-start: 1px solid blue;
	border-inline-end: 1px solid blue;
}

.border-width {
	border-block-start-width: 1px;
	border-block-end-width: 2px;
	border-inline-end-width: 4px;
	border-inline-start-width: 3px;
}

.border-style {
	border-block-start-style: solid;
	border-block-end-style: dashed;
	border-inline-start-style: double;
	border-inline-end-style: dotted;
}

.border-color {
	border-block-start-color: red;
	border-block-end-color: blue;
	border-inline-start-color: green;
	border-inline-end-color: yellow;
}

.same-values-collapse {
	margin-block-start: 1px;
	margin-block-end: 1px;
}

.important {
	border-block-start-width: 1px !important;
	border-block-end-width: 2px !important;
}

.conflicting-physical-longhand {
	margin-block-start: 1px;
	margin-top: 2px;
	margin-block-end: 3px;
}

```

